Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.50,0:00:12.22,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,And that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.22,0:00:13.84,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,With this, at long last...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.84,0:00:14.82,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,It's finally...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.49,0:00:17.78,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.58,0:00:25.50,Default,Student1,0,0,0,,One melon and yakisoba bread!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.58,0:00:25.50,Default-Alt,Student2,0,0,0,,Cream bread please! Cream bread!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.50,0:00:26.87,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Pshuu...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.87,0:00:27.96,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}Pshuu...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.96,0:00:30.67,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Pshuuu...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.61,0:00:32.63,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Pshuuu...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.97,0:00:35.86,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,One egg salad sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.86,0:00:37.60,Default,Obaasan,0,0,0,,Here, one egg salad sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.21,0:00:41.31,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I finally...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.31,0:00:43.39,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I finally bought it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.32,0:00:46.06,Default,Obaasan,0,0,0,,Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.06,0:00:50.53,Default,Obaasan,0,0,0,,I wasn't sure if you'd be able to buy one\N on your own before you graduated.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.82,0:00:53.55,Default,Obaasan,0,0,0,,This is on the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.38,0:00:55.99,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.41,0:01:01.01,Default,Fanclub1,0,0,0,[term fix],Lady Sophy bought herself bread without our help.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.01,0:01:02.95,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,Chanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.57,0:02:36.93,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,The Man From Brazil.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.74,0:02:40.91,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,This monja riceball is delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.93,0:02:43.08,Default,Leona,0,0,0,[term fix],If you say so, Dorothy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.76,0:02:45.11,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Are you gonna eat that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.11,0:02:50.27,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I got this plum rice ball from the\N lady running the lunch stand, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.27,0:02:51.69,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,[term fix],Would you like it, Laala?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.69,0:02:52.46,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.46,0:02:54.36,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Yeah! Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.36,0:02:55.51,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.51,0:02:59.41,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I only have Red Flash before concerts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.41,0:03:01.48,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Then I'll help myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.41,0:03:04.20,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.63,0:03:06.87,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Sour!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.87,0:03:11.31,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,That reminds me, {Head Disciplinarian Minami}you already had {herself} a solo concert.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.31,0:03:12.34,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,That's so unfair.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.34,0:03:16.80,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,All because our spineless manager \Nhas holed himself up in a beauty parlor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.28,0:03:20.51,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,[term fix],{\i1}If Dressing Pafé reforms,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.51,0:03:24.45,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,{\i1}that curse will take away my handsomeness-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.45,0:03:27.60,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's no way I'm letting that happen-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.60,0:03:29.98,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,{\i1}Anti-aging-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.32,0:03:32.76,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Kuma and Usagi both believe in this curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.76,0:03:33.94,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,How strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.94,0:03:36.76,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,That stupid Usagi has gone weak in the knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.76,0:03:38.10,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,How pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.10,0:03:40.20,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Once convinced, there's no changing his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.20,0:03:42.41,Default,Shion,0,0,0,[hard to read?],At this point, anything we say just \Ngoes in one ear and out the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.41,0:03:45.62,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I wonder what kind of curse it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.63,0:03:48.36,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,So you're afraid of curses.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.36,0:03:50.33,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,[term fix],You're a real chicken, Laala!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.34,0:03:55.31,Default-Alt,Dorthy,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I made fun of curses!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.31,0:03:57.60,Default-Alt,Dorthy,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.51,0:03:57.60,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.60,0:03:59.96,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Even a moment of weakness can prove fatal in the jungle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.10,0:04:05.80,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,It silently circles around behind its prey,\N ready to strike at any moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.06,0:04:11.95,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.95,0:04:13.35,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,A gold medal!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.35,0:04:14.86,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,What's with you, old man?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.86,0:04:16.57,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,You can't just sneak up on people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.57,0:04:18.40,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,These are school grounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.40,0:04:20.66,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Outsiders are prohibited from entering here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.66,0:04:22.81,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,My my my.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.81,0:04:24.01,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Calm yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.01,0:04:26.18,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,I am no stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.18,0:04:30.37,Default,Dad,0,0,0,[term fix],I'm only here to hug my truly beloved Sophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.85,0:04:32.84,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Forcing a hug on a young lady...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.84,0:04:35.05,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Is inexcusable!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.05,0:04:37.26,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,How utterly revolting!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.59,0:04:41.80,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Regardless of how passionate a fan you are...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.80,0:04:43.76,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,This is absurd, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.76,0:04:46.82,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,It's a headmistress's duty to protect her students!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.82,0:04:48.23,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,This shall not go unpunished!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.56,0:04:49.59,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.59,0:04:51.19,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Please stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.19,0:04:52.02,Default,3,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.02,0:04:52.94,Default,2,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.94,0:04:53.90,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.37,0:04:56.59,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.59,0:04:58.52,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.52,0:04:59.59,Default,3,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.48,0:05:03.22,Default,3,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.41,0:05:10.56,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Please excuse us.\NWe had no idea you were her father.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.56,0:05:12.25,Default,Others,0,0,0,,We're sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.25,0:05:14.88,Default,Dad,0,0,0,[term fix],Well, I had to find Sophy as soon as I could,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.88,0:05:17.84,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,so I rushed straight here from the airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.84,0:05:21.63,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Of course my actions made it look strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.51,0:05:26.18,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,[term fix],He's totally different from you, Sophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.68,0:05:29.10,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I take after my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.10,0:05:32.90,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Unlike myself, my father's full of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.90,0:05:35.15,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,After all, he's an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.15,0:05:35.86,Default,All,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.86,0:05:37.11,Default,All,0,0,0,,An adventurer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.11,0:05:40.57,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Here's my card.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.57,0:05:42.15,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Ah, let's see here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.15,0:05:46.28,Default,Title,0,0,0,,King of Adventure, location: Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.28,0:05:49.75,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,When you're an adventurer, every day is full of excitement!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.16,0:05:52.71,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Taking killer pictures on the back of a killer whale,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.71,0:05:55.42,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,owling in a giant owl sleeping bag,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.46,0:05:57.38,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,tagging a tiger,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.38,0:05:59.63,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,being pigged up on by a bunch of pigs...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.63,0:06:01.72,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Your gags are beyond the max!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.97,0:06:05.26,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Headmistress, I've brought you a souvenir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.26,0:06:07.14,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,A-A snake?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.14,0:06:09.81,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,It's a fake made out of rubber.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.81,0:06:13.69,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,The zipper on the side makes it\Ngreat for storing bamboo poles.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.69,0:06:15.65,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,I-I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.90,0:06:19.90,Default,Dad,0,0,0,[term fix],To be honest, we've been separated for quite some time,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.90,0:06:22.65,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,but now we'll be able to live together once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.65,0:06:24.61,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,That's what I came to tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.91,0:06:26.49,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.49,0:06:28.08,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[term fix],Isn't that great, Sophy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.08,0:06:31.66,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Since I lack the physical strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.66,0:06:38.04,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,my father has been flying around the world\N in search of the legendary powerful plum.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.29,0:06:40.55,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Powerful plum?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.55,0:06:42.21,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.21,0:06:43.84,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,When it comes to its power,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.84,0:06:46.72,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,it's said that one can run 30,000 meters with just one,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.72,0:06:48.55,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,making it the ultimate plum!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.76,0:06:50.01,Default,All,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.93,0:06:55.48,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,However, even after ten long years,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.48,0:06:59.36,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,I still haven't found that legendary powerful plum.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.36,0:07:02.36,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,But I'll never give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.36,0:07:04.74,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,If I can't find it, I'll just grow it myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.38,0:07:11.45,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,So I purchased a stockpile of legendary-grade\N plum seeds from a Prazilian merchant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.95,0:07:14.08,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Her dad sure is decisive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.08,0:07:17.17,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I require precise calculations,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.17,0:07:18.92,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,so we're complete opposites in that regard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.92,0:07:20.63,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Do not fear failure!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.63,0:07:22.30,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Challenge yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.30,0:07:24.72,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Those are my mottos.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.42,0:07:28.89,Default,Dad,0,0,0,[honorific],That is why I give you this, madam...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.89,0:07:30.43,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Yes yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.43,0:07:32.10,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,A t-transfer notification?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.10,0:07:33.81,Default,5,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.31,0:07:36.06,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,[honorific],Father, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.06,0:07:38.60,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,[notanemdash],You never said anything about transfer—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.15,0:07:41.73,Default,Dad,0,0,0,[term fix],Are you surprised, Sophy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.73,0:07:46.24,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Your father has created Prifornia,\Na 10,000 hectare plum plantation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.24,0:07:48.57,Default,Others,0,0,0,,Prifornia?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.57,0:07:49.87,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,What prefecture is that in?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.87,0:07:50.95,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,It's another country.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.95,0:07:52.20,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.20,0:07:55.16,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[term fix],That means Sophy's going to another country?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.16,0:07:58.62,Default,Dad,0,0,0,[term fix],Sophy and I will be leaving Japan next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.25,0:08:03.59,Default,Dad,0,0,0,[term fix],And we'll arrive just in time to have \Nthe plum flowers greet you in full bloom, Sophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.76,0:08:06.49,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[term fix],Sophy...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.01,0:08:13.60,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[term fix],Sophy...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.60,0:08:17.02,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Are you really going to Prifornia?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.02,0:08:18.48,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.31,0:09:01.85,Default,Alokan,0,0,0,,Making Drama Switch On!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.36,0:09:12.62,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Wondrous Angel à la mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.33,0:09:16.95,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Don't mind if I do.
Comment: 0,0:09:16.95,0:09:19.04,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.04,0:09:21.12,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.04,0:09:21.12,Default-Alt,Mikan,0,0,0,,Yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.29,0:09:25.09,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Cyalume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.98,0:09:49.82,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,You're full-blown celebrities-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.82,0:09:50.95,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,I'm super happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.95,0:09:52.11,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Of course we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.11,0:09:56.03,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,After all, our destiny is to become Divine Idols.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.03,0:10:02.00,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Next up is SoLaMi SMILE's hit concert\N from before their disbandment.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.00,0:10:06.25,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,The three of them get along perfectly!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.25,0:10:07.96,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,[term fix],Exactly what I'd expect of SoLaMi SMILE.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.13,0:10:10.67,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,However, according to my research,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.67,0:10:16.10,Default,Neko,0,0,0,[term fix],Sophy's dad has returned home and asked her to live with him in Prifornia.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.39,0:10:19.14,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,There's plenty of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.14,0:10:23.27,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,[term fix],Aroma Prophecy Grimoire, chapter 8, section 184:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.27,0:10:26.65,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,"Recall the lightening which tears the sky."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.20,0:10:38.83,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Derodero derosaimu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.83,0:10:40.95,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,While it seems to trouble thee,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.95,0:10:45.62,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,[term fix],I'll say that SoLaMi SMILE is not a proper fit for thee.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.62,0:10:49.88,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I hath seen what thine future has in store.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.88,0:10:51.42,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I won't go into the unfortunate details,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.42,0:10:55.09,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,[term fix],but it would be to thy advantage to break away from SoLaMi SMILE.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.09,0:10:57.89,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,[term fix],Break away from SoLaMi SMILE?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.35,0:11:03.31,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,[term fix],If ye continue to team up with the overly powerful Laala and Mirei,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.31,0:11:07.10,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,thine presence shall continue to dwindle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.81,0:11:11.73,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,That is, so to say, a step toward being an invisible idol.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.73,0:11:12.94,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Hey there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.94,0:11:15.07,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Mikan the angel here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.07,0:11:18.74,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Spending time abroad with your father sounds wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.74,0:11:24.79,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,There's lot of fun things to eat in other countries, \Nlike big hamburgers and pizza!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.79,0:11:26.58,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,I'd be completely jealous!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.75,0:11:31.25,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Pitiful lamb, worry about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.25,0:11:32.55,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Yes, be troubled!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.55,0:11:35.42,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,When people are struggling and\Nsuffering with their problems,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.42,0:11:39.72,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,that is the greatest feast for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.06,0:11:43.35,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Demon Demon Deruderu Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.35,0:11:45.77,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Jello-jello Angel!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.56,0:11:51.98,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[term fix],So this is where you've been, Sophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.24,0:11:57.11,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.57,0:12:06.83,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,My father's been searching for a\Npowerful plum for me for ten years,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.83,0:12:08.54,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,and he's finally found some.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.54,0:12:09.46,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.46,0:12:12.88,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I love my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.97,0:12:21.51,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[term fix],Hey, Sophy, you know how we're doing our best to reform SoLaMi SMILE?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.05,0:12:22.85,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.85,0:12:28.56,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Well, if living together with your father\Nthat you love so much will make you happy,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.56,0:12:30.60,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I won't stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.60,0:12:32.44,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I'll support you all the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.44,0:12:33.52,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,[term fix],Laala...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.52,0:12:36.07,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I feel the same way-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.07,0:12:38.45,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Don't worry about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.45,0:12:41.74,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,You should choose the path that you want-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.91,0:12:44.16,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,That I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.29,0:12:46.54,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,That I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.67,0:12:54.92,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I don't want to go to Prifornia!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.92,0:12:58.92,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,[term fix],I want to continue PriPara'ing with you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.92,0:13:00.43,Default,Larelle,0,0,0,[term fix],Sophy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.43,0:13:01.64,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.64,0:13:03.60,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,That makes me really happy-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.56,0:13:12.22,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,[term fix],Now you just need to tell\Nyour father how you truly feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.69,0:13:19.53,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I don't want to see\Nmy beloved father saddened.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.90,0:13:20.95,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,You're family.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.95,0:13:23.28,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,You shouldn't keep anything from each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.28,0:13:25.49,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,You have to tell him about how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.83,0:13:29.62,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Your father did it because he wanted to-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.62,0:13:31.46,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I'm sure he'll understand-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.88,0:13:36.80,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,[term fix],Laala, Mirei, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.80,0:13:37.67,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.13,0:13:42.13,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,go tell my father how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.39,0:13:47.68,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,You here, honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.68,0:13:50.39,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Ah, welcome back-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.39,0:13:52.27,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,The usual-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.40,0:13:55.02,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.02,0:13:56.19,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Why are you here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.19,0:13:57.94,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,I should be saying the same thing-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.94,0:13:59.32,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Wha'd you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.32,0:14:03.28,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Would the two of you care for bratcurse?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.28,0:14:04.95,Default,Both,0,0,0,,Bratcurse?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.95,0:14:07.24,Default,Nako,0,0,0,,Bratwurst-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.24,0:14:08.45,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,You scared us-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.45,0:14:11.46,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,We're quite sensitive to the word "curse" as of late-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.46,0:14:13.50,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Though, I'll take one-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.50,0:14:14.75,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.75,0:14:17.38,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Just give me a moment-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.38,0:14:20.05,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Because my accursed movements are a little slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.05,0:14:22.51,Default,2,0,0,0,,A curse?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.01,0:14:28.10,Default,2,0,0,0,,It's cute how you easily scare-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.35,0:14:35.94,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,This is the Prifornia plum plantation that we'll be living at.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.94,0:14:38.57,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,What do you think? It's huge, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.57,0:14:39.65,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,[honorific],Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.65,0:14:41.44,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,To tell you the truth, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.44,0:14:44.03,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,There's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.03,0:14:48.49,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Your father will handle all of\Nthe heavy lifting at the plantation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.49,0:14:49.37,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.37,0:14:49.87,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.87,0:14:56.50,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I don't want to go to Prifornia!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.50,0:14:59.25,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,There's still things I want to do here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.63,0:15:04.01,Default,Dad,0,0,0,[term fix],Sophy, explain it to me slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.80,0:15:05.47,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.47,0:15:06.55,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.55,0:15:09.76,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,I'm in the middle of a complicated discussion...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.93,0:15:10.97,Default,Dad [time gap 170ms],0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.97,0:15:12.98,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,You're kidding?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.85,0:15:18.15,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Now then, I'll go unwind at Neko Cafe again today-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.15,0:15:18.94,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,[honorific],Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.94,0:15:19.52,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.36,0:15:23.19,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Enter me into a concert.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.57,0:15:24.57,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.07,0:15:28.37,Default,Larelle,0,0,0,[term fix],Sophy's doing a solo concert?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.53,0:15:31.95,Default,Fanclub1,0,0,0,[term fix][honorific],You said Lady Sophy's having a solo concert?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.95,0:15:33.50,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,Chanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.50,0:15:36.12,Default,Fanclub1,0,0,0,,It appears buying bread at the school cafe wasn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.12,0:15:39.50,Default,Fanclub1,0,0,0,,Now she's trying to do a solo concert on her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.50,0:15:43.13,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,[term fix][honorific],We, her Royal Guard, will cheer Lady Sophy on...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.13,0:15:45.63,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,[honorific],with the ultimate cheer we've been working on-chanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.18,0:15:51.01,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,Chanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.01,0:15:52.35,Default,Fanclub1,0,0,0,[term fix][honorific],Lady Sophy...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.35,0:15:53.56,Default,All,0,0,0,,is life!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.52,0:15:56.27,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.27,0:15:57.64,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,You're kidding?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.23,0:16:00.65,Default,Sister,0,0,0,[honorific],What happened, Father?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.65,0:16:03.23,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,It's already done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.23,0:16:08.57,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Although the several hundred seeds I planted have bloomed,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.57,0:16:11.16,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,there wasn't a single plum to be found;
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.16,0:16:13.33,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,they were all cherries.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.12,0:16:15.50,Default,Both,0,0,0,[honorific],Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.04,0:16:17.96,Default-Alt,Sister,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.04,0:16:17.96,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,[honorific],Pull yourself together, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.79,0:16:22.34,Default,Sis,0,0,0,,He just naturally goes at cosmic speed,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.34,0:16:24.71,Default,Sis,0,0,0,,and never stops to think things through.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.71,0:16:26.51,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,[honorific],How unfortunate, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.51,0:16:29.93,Default,Sis,0,0,0,,He might not be able to get back on\N his feet quickly like he normally does.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.93,0:16:31.26,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.11,0:16:41.15,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Please scan the appropriate number\Nof My Tickets for your coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.69,0:16:43.48,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Coord Change, start!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.82,0:16:48.82,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,A late blooming sakura coord decorated with cherry blossoms in full bloom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.82,0:16:53.24,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,[term fix],The dyed purple sakura leaves add\N a "cool" feeling; the perfect for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.24,0:16:55.79,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Flower Blossom Floral Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.09,0:17:06.05,Default-Alt,Fan,0,0,0,[term fix][honorific],I love you, Lady Sophy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.05,0:17:07.26,Default-Alt,Fan2,0,0,0,,So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.26,0:17:09.47,Default-Alt,Fan2,0,0,0,,So beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.47,0:17:13.68,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Have you been good, my little cagebirds?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.68,0:17:15.39,Default,All,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.35,0:17:17.93,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.85,0:17:25.52,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I've prepared the perfect song for you naughty little girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.86,0:17:30.49,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,"Solar Flare Sherbet: Sakura Shower Version".
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.74,0:18:15.24,Default,All,0,0,0,[term fix],Sophy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.24,0:18:18.20,Default,Dad,0,0,0,[term fix],S-Sophy...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.20,0:18:21.54,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,You've got this much energy now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.54,0:18:25.17,Default,Sis,0,0,0,,Performing in PriPara is her energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.84,0:18:37.30,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Making Drama Switch On!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.30,0:18:39.26,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Plums, peaches...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.26,0:18:41.06,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Cherry blossoms in full bloom!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.36,0:18:50.07,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Liberation Maiden: Primavera!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.24,0:18:55.24,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Cyalume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.13,0:19:21.39,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,[honorific],{\i1}Cheer up, Father. Sakura and plums are both plums.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.64,0:19:23.98,Default,Dad,0,0,0,[term fix],S-Sophy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.24,0:19:41.62,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Purple, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.62,0:19:44.20,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,[term fix][honorific],Miss Sophy is a Cool-type idol, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.96,0:19:50.38,Default,Sis,0,0,0,,You're really heading back already?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.38,0:19:52.09,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Even though I wasn't able to get dried plums,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.09,0:19:54.26,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,the cherry trees will grow cherries.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.26,0:19:56.26,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,I need to rush back and harvest them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.88,0:19:59.22,Default,Dad,0,0,0,[term fix],That's what your concert taught me, Sophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.22,0:20:00.68,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,[honorific],Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.51,0:20:05.35,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Thank you for that wonderful show.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.35,0:20:08.73,Default,Dad,0,0,0,[term fix],You've always lacked physical strength, Sophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.73,0:20:12.23,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,With that energetic performance\N you put on with everyone's support,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.23,0:20:15.28,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,you've made your old man so proud he could ascend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.28,0:20:18.91,Default,Dad,0,0,0,[term fix],Sophy, keep giving your all at PriPara,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.91,0:20:20.41,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,and become a divine idol!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.82,0:20:23.37,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,[honorific],Thank you, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.74,0:20:25.83,Default,Dad,0,0,0,[term fix][honorific],Laala, Mirei,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.83,0:20:28.21,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,please continue to look after my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.21,0:20:29.04,Default,Larelle,0,0,0,,Will do!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.13,0:20:36.01,Default,Larelle,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.05,0:20:39.51,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Pshuu...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.51,0:20:40.68,Default,Others,0,0,0,[term fix],Sophy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.68,0:20:41.51,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Pshuu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.51,0:20:42.76,Default,Sis,0,0,0,,My goodness,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.76,0:20:45.77,Default,Sis,0,0,0,,you really did a cosmic job this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.48,0:20:48.77,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Sophy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.60,0:20:54.57,Default,Neko,0,0,0,[term fix],The SoLaMi SMILE break-up strategy was a complete failure-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.57,0:20:57.78,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Her flower filled concert was spectacular!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.78,0:21:01.36,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,But Mikan likes meat buns more than flowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.36,0:21:03.49,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,The prophecy didn't come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.49,0:21:07.58,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Now that it's come to this, I shall consult\N the forbidden and most horrific prophecy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.63,0:21:15.42,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,The next prophecy; chapter 7, section 666:
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.42,0:21:17.96,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,"The one with crimson eyes strikes back."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.96,0:21:20.51,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,[honorific],If I turn the large number of Meganees into zombies,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.51,0:21:22.22,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,[term fix],SoLaMi SMILE will...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.22,0:21:25.26,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,No, I'll be able to take down {\i1}everyone{\i0} in PriPara!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.06,0:21:30.73,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Demon Demon Deruderu Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.73,0:21:34.36,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,182)}Demon Demon Deruderu Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.95,0:23:07.74,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,There's a problem-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.74,0:23:10.20,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Do you think you can do a concert\Nat the Dream Theatre-kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.04,0:23:13.46,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,We don't even have a five person team yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.46,0:23:16.71,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,It has been decided you will have your debut live at the theater's completion ceremony-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.71,0:23:20.21,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,However, the catch is,\Nyou have to win the sports festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.21,0:23:20.96,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.96,0:23:24.34,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,We'll win and reform!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.34,0:23:26.38,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Wait, if you do that, the curse...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.38,0:23:28.30,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,I'm in trouble-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.30,0:23:29.14,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Next time:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.14,0:23:31.72,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,First to the Dream Theatre-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.72,0:23:33.06,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Aim for your dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.06,0:23:34.52,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Let's go PriPara!
